> [dbcd3a9](https://github.com/bitcoin/bitcoin/pull/36033/changes/dbcd3a9bfd9f7e9dab602120bc3cdc550b0c276d) _refactor: Use std::views::zip in btck import blocks_:

The zip loop reads a length before checking whether its path is null.

<details><summary>Example patch</summary>

```diff
diff --git a/src/kernel/bitcoinkernel.cpp b/src/kernel/bitcoinkernel.cpp
